					"id": 751501511,
					"content": "嗚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501512,
					"content": "不，我並非沒有名字，我是……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龍僕"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501513,
					"content": "我是唯一一個有資格擁有智慧的非領主龍僕個體，在修庫特爾大人隕落之後，我仍負責最基礎的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龍僕"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501514,
					"content": "城市最基礎的維護和資訊的記錄。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龍僕"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501515,
					"content": "…不過，因為陰影之大敵的侵入，紀錄散佚了一部分，所以，現在並沒有自己名稱的資料。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龍僕"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501516,
					"content": "呃，看來的確是我們認錯人了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501517,
					"content": "沒有關係。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龍僕"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501518,
					"content": "唔，這隻機器人雖然大，但是看上去呆呆的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501519,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，看來還真的不是那個躲在機器裡說話的傢伙…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501520,
					"content": "不過它不是說自己負責記錄…唔，記錄資訊嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501521,
					"content": "不如就問問看它知道什麼，或者…呃，怎麼去那個聖山之心吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501522,
						751501523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501522,
					"content": "或許「那個人」就是這個意思…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501524
					]
				},
